 434T102 436Q119 437 138 438T167 441T178 442H181V402Q181 364 182 364T187 369T199 384T218 402T247 421T285 437Q305 442 336 442Q450 438 463 329Q464 322 464 190V104Q464 66 466 59T477 49Q498 46 526 46H542V0H534L510 1Q487 2 460 2T422 3Q319 3 310 0H302V46H318Q379 46 379 62Q380 64 380 200Q379 335 378 343Q372 371 358 385T334 402T308 404Q263 404 229 370Q202 343 195 315T187 232V168V108Q187 78 188 68T191 55T200 49Q221 46 249 46H265V0H257L234 1Q210 2 183 2T145 3Q42 3 33 0H25V46H41Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6C\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6F\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-67\" x=\"779\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-65\" x=\"1809\" y=\"-343\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"1876\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2726\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3782,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6C\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-6E\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"4784\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"5356\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>Taking the natural logarithm of both sides, we have that\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"16.549ex\" height=\"7.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -3.005ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1796 7125.2 3089.6\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; posit